# ImageDef Preview

## Summary
The display formats that ship with raster image defs: dimension-aware
rendering where fitted FILLS its container and embedded letterboxes —
the image counterpart of a field's built-in editor.

## Example
```ts
import { RasterImageDef } from 'https://cardstack.com/base/image-file-def';

@field photo = linksTo(RasterImageDef);
```
```gts
<@fields.photo @format='fitted' />  {{! fills }}
<@fields.photo @format='embedded' /> {{! letterboxes }}
```
